                        "review": "Despite its simplistic presentation, Trap Them is an incredibly clever, deviously difficult game that I consider up there with some of the greatest puzzle games of all time. And while it doesn't have the presentation/story of games like Portal or Braid, it makes do with pure quality gameplay/puzzle design.\r\n\r\nThe game is going to become free in a week. Buy it now to support the devs!",
